  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AHRDO Legislative Theatre Afghanistan 2013-2014 - AHRDO Legislative Theatre Afghanistan 2013-2014.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">AHRDO Legislative Theatre Afghanistan 2013-2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AHRDO is an Afghan non-governmental organization founded to promote   democracy and human rights in Afghanistan. The organization uses a    variety artistic methodologies (participative theatre) combined with  a human rights approach. The overall objective of the project isto    contribute to the enhancement of women&apos;s political participation. The proposal includes tha active participation of men in the activities.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Afghanistan Human Rights and Democracy Organization (AHRDO) &apos;s        initiative syftar till att st&#xe4;rka kvinnors politiska deltagande, samt verka f&#xf6;r en lagstiftning som tar h&#xe4;nsyn till kvinnors behov och      situation. Verksamheten ska bedrivas genom innovative metoder         relaterade till deltagande teater som ger kvinnor och m&#xe4;n en          m&#xf6;jlighet att uttrycka sig om &#xe4;mnet.</narrative>
  </description>
